                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The health care premium increases Republicans want to force down our throats will be catastrophic. In my district, we\u2019ll see over 400% increases \u2013 and next door in Rep. LaMalfa\u2019s district, we\u2019ll see over 500%.\n\nRepublicans need to reverse course and help us save health care.",
