                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans' reckless cuts to health care are already affecting people in our community, and that\u2019s why I refuse to budge during this shutdown. There's simply too much at stake.\n\nHere's a look at what some of our neighbors are up against: https://t.co/Gvd6tQClFH",
