                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Many of you have probably seen the stories I\u2019ve shared from my constituents on how this Republican health care crisis is hurting people.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nI want you to hear directly from Sophia \u2014 her story is exactly why my Democratic colleagues and I are fighting this fight on your behalf. https://t.co/LZYc31LGIV",
